# gene

--- HookDude_Homing | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_GENE_HOMING_DESC
raw  Gene shoots a homing missile at all visible opponents within a large area, dealing up to <VALUE2> damage based on distance.
now  Gene shoots a homing missile at all visible opponents within a large area, dealing up to <VALUE2> damage based on distance.
