now  All enemies close to Gene are instantly pushed back. If at least one enemy Brawler is within range, Gene will also restore <VALUE1>% of his max health.
  VALUE1  -  -> 10

--- HookDude_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_HOOK_DESC
